# Private files. This repo is public and shared with the team; anything named
# *.local.md stays on the machine that created it. Kept as a guard even though
# nothing in the plugin reads a .local.md file any more — a stray one holding
# real estimates would name internal services, tickets and customers.
*.local.md

# Stray estimates. Real ones land in the product repo's ./estimates/ directory
# and are committed there. Anchored to the repo root on purpose — an unanchored
# pattern also matches agents/estimate-validator.md, which took a commit to
# notice.
/estimate-*.md
/estimates/
